%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant C as 🤖 Claude (VS Code)
    participant M as ⚙️ MCP Server
    participant K as 📨 Kafka Broker

    Note over U,K: Topic Creation Flow (Happy Path)
    
    U->>C: "Create topic 'orders' with 5 partitions"
    
    activate C
    Note right of C: Think: Analyze request<br/>Identify: create_topic tool
    
    C->>M: tools/call("create_topic", {name: "orders", partitions: 5})
    deactivate C
    
    activate M
    Note right of M: Execute KafkaAdminService.createTopic()
    
    M->>K: AdminClient.createTopics()
    activate K
    K-->>M: TopicCreated
    deactivate K
    
    M-->>C: {success: true, topic: "orders", partitions: 5}
    deactivate M
    
    activate C
    Note right of C: Format response<br/>for human
    C-->>U: "✓ Topic 'orders' created with 5 partitions"
    deactivate C

    Note over U,K: Topic Creation Flow (With Rollback on Failure)
    
    U->>C: "Provision topic 'orders' for team-a"
    
    activate C
    Note right of C: Think: Full provisioning needed<br/>Steps: create_topic → create_sa → assign_acl → email
    
    C->>M: tools/call("create_topic", {name: "orders"})
    M-->>C: {success: true}
    
    C->>M: tools/call("create_service_account", {topic: "orders"})
    M-->>C: {success: true, sa: "orders-sa"}
    
    C->>M: tools/call("assign_acl", {sa: "orders-sa", topic: "orders"})
    M-->>C: {error: "Permission denied"}
    
    Note right of C: ⚠️ Failure! Initiate rollback
    
    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over C,M: ROLLBACK PHASE
        C->>M: tools/call("delete_service_account", {sa: "orders-sa"})
        M-->>C: {success: true}
        
        C->>M: tools/call("delete_topic", {name: "orders"})
        M-->>C: {success: true}
    end
    
    C-->>U: "❌ Failed: ACL assignment denied.<br/>All changes rolled back.<br/>Contact admin for permissions."
    deactivate C
